  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>For non-trivial solutions<br /><br /><math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>7</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>7</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>3</mn><mi>&#952;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> or <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math><br /><br />Since <math><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>